+// ReturnError is the sentinel error used to implement the "return" keyword.
+// It is raised (as a panic) when the "return" template function is called, and
+// trapped when the template (or the template invoked with "template") finishes executing.
+// ExecuteWithContext returns it, unwrapped, if the executed template returned early,
